arlier test files (test_normalizer) may MUTATE state? `registry.register` called post-finalize by...? No — loaders only. Hmm, but `service.registry` finalize... `TeamRegistry.resolve` doesn't mutate. \n\nHmm — but wait: test_server.py fixture `mcp_session` is module-scoped async; test_statistics has `test_cold_load_and_query_under_budget` creating a FRESH load — no mutation of shared.\n\nLet me look at actual failure outputs for stats/derbies/players tests.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b5acd6f001DCeYWXS6z2chUT","sessionID":"ses_fa4ccfc0bffexSFu2vIRQjobrF","messageID":"msg_05b59e4f7001v9LO1vNqgXcCxw"}}
