, \"fluminense-pi\", \"fluminense de feira-ba\" (suffix \"ba\"). Hmm what about ordering — Counter.most_common ties? rj=420ish should dominate.\n\nHmm, WAIT — maybe \"Fluminense-RJ\" barely occurs because Brasileirao_Matches writes \"Fluminense-RJ\"... let me check the RAW file: Brasileirao_Matches home names: 'Fluminense-RJ'? Earlier sample showed \"Palmeiras-SP\", \"Sport-PE\", \"Flamengo-RJ\" — so yes suffixed. Count ≈ every Fluminense game 2012-2022 in that file. Fluminense played Série A every year 2012-2022 → ~38×11 ≈ 418 rows → count 418. rj should win...\n\nUnless — AH HA!!! I finally see it!!! **`_default_state_for` iterates `self._provisional.items()` — but for base \"fluminense\", the pid \"fluminense de feira-ba\"... no. Hmm.**\n\nLet me stop guessing and just print `registry._default_state_for(\"fluminense\")` + the provisional counts + remap in ONE run, plus check what raw string the novo 2015 \"fluminense-pi\" rows had.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b5d5442001maWjsfOq5ofR1Z","sessionID":"ses_fa4ccfc0bffexSFu2vIRQjobrF","messageID":"msg_05b5ca1c10012SsIhqVB271xlx"}}
