{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788239826310,"sessionID":"ses_fa4ccfc0bffexSFu2vIRQjobrF","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_2ee422d33cf74da8a2f89016","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"timeout 60 ./venv/bin/python << 'EOF'\n# Final demo: natural-language-style questions through the MCP tools\nimport asyncio\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.loaders import load_all\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.service import SoccerService\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.server import build_server\nfrom mcp.client._memory import InMemoryTransport\nfrom mcp.client.session import ClientSession\n\nQUESTIONS = [\n    (\"standings\", {\"competition\": \"brasileirao\", \"season\": 2019}, \"Who won the 2019 Brasileirão?\"),\n    (\"head_to_head\", {\"team_a\": \"Flamengo\", \"team_b\": \"Fluminense\"}, \"Show me all Flamengo vs Fluminense matches\"),\n    (\"team_record\", {\"team\": \"Corinthians\", \"season\": 2022, \"competition\": \"brasileirao\", \"venue\": \"home\"}, \"What is Corinthians' home record in 2022?\"),\n    (\"top_brazilian_players\", {\"limit\": 3}, \"Who are the top Brazilian players?\"),\n    (\"champion\", {\"competition\": \"libertadores\", \"season\": 2019}, \"Who won the 2019 Libertadores?\"),\n    (\"biggest_wins\", {\"limit\": 3}, \"Show me the biggest wins in the dataset\"),\n    (\"derbies\", {\"season\": 2023}, \"Show me all derbies in 2023\"),\n    (\"competition_stats\", {\"competition\": \"brasileirao\"}, \"What's the average goals per match in the Brasileirão?\"),\n    (\"relegated\", {\"competition\": \"brasileirao\", \"season\": 2020}, \"Which teams were relegated in 2020?\"),\n    (\"team_overview\", {\"team\": \"Santos\"}, \"What competitions has Santos played in?\"),\n]\n\nasync def main():\n    server = build_server(SoccerService(load_all(\"data/kaggle\")))\n    async with InMemoryTransport(server) as t:\n        async with ClientSession(t[0], t[1]) as s:\n            await s.initialize()\n            for tool, args, question in QUESTIONS:\n                res = await s.call_tool(tool, args)\n                text = res.content[0].text\n                first = text.split(\"\\n\")[0]\n                tail = text.split(\"\\n\")[-1] if len(text.split(\"\\n\")) > 1 else \"\"\n                print(f\"Q: {question}\")\n                print(f\"A: {first}\")\n                if tail != first: print(f\"   {tail}\")\n                print()\n\nasyncio.run(main())\nEOF","timeout":90000},"output":"Q: Who won the 2019 Brasileirão?\nA: 2019 Brasileirão Série A Standings (calculated from matches):\n   ... (5 more in dataset)\n\nQ: Show me all Flamengo vs Fluminense matches\nA: Flamengo vs Fluminense (Fla-Flu):\n   Head-to-head in dataset: Flamengo 18 wins, Fluminense 15 wins, 13 draws (goals: Flamengo 63, Fluminense 52)\n\nQ: What is Corinthians' home record in 2022?\nA: Corinthians home record (2022 Brasileirão Série A):\n   - Win rate: 66.7%\n\nQ: Who are the top Brazilian players?\nA: Top-rated Brazilian players in dataset:\n   3. Coutinho - Overall: 88, Position: LW, Club: FC Barcelona, Age: 26, Nationality: Brazil\n\nQ: Who won the 2019 Libertadores?\nA: 2019 Copa Libertadores final(s):\n   Aggregate: Flamengo 2-1 River Plate -> Champion: Flamengo\n\nQ: Show me the biggest wins in the dataset\nA: Biggest victories in the dataset:\n   3. 2020-03-11: River Plate 8-0 Binacional (Copa Libertadores)\n\nQ: Show me all derbies in 2023\nA: Derby matches (29):\n   ... (14 more in dataset)\n\nQ: What's the average goals per match in the Brasileirão?\nA: Statistics for Brasileirão Série A:\n   - Away win rate: 23.9%\n\nQ: Which teams were relegated in 2020?\nA: Relegation zone, brasileirao 2020:\n   4. Vasco da Gama - 41 pts (10W, 11D, 17L)\n\nQ: What competitions has Santos played in?\nA: Santos (canonical id: santos-sp)\n   FIFA squad: 20 players (see club_squad tool)\n\n","metadata":{"output":"Q: Who won the 2019 Brasileirão?\nA: 2019 Brasileirão Série A Standings (calculated from matches):\n   ... (5 more in da